 rings\, tarot card readings\, and special event-day perks. Wine Club and A
 llocation members enjoy a special ticket price of $95 \\(regularly $125\\)
 . Not a member yet? Join the Wine Club to enjoy the member ticket price. T
 ake home your favorites\, and your ticket is complimentary with a 3-bottle
  purchase \\(one ticket per purchase\\). Space is limited\, so reserve now
  and join us for an enchanting afternoon on the Hill.
