UID:261022s1d_j8x0BUWppwUwrfzV6Q
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate fall at the Santa Rosa Pumpkin Patch in Sonoma Count
 y! This family-friendly fall destination features eight acres of pumpkins\
 , a giant seven-acre corn maze\, and tons of fun activities for kids of al
 l ages! Enjoy hay rides\, kiddie corn mazes\, a sunflower maze\, a giant j
 umpy pillow\, pedal trikes\, a hay pyramid\, tire swings\, a corn play box
 \, a petting zoo\, face painting\, and more. Pony rides are available on w
 eekends\, and food and treats are available for purchase. Admission: Pumpk
 in Patch Pass: $5 \\(general admission\, petting zoo\, games\, hay pyramid
 \, and corn play box\\) Farm Pass: $20 \\(includes unlimited jumpy pillows
  and inflatables\\) Farm Pass Plus\\+: $30 \\(includes corn maze\, apple b
 lasters\, and a hayride or cow train ride\\) Corn Maze Pass: $12 Children 
 ages 2 and under: Free general admission Pumpkins and select attractions c
 ost extra. Location: 5157 Stony Point Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95407 \\(near
  Rohnert Park\\). Hours: Monday-Thursday: 11 am-7 pm Friday: 11 am-9 pm Sa
 turday: 9 am-9 pm Sunday: 9 am-8 pm
LOCATION:Santa Rosa Pumpkin Patch 5157 Stony Point Road
URL:https://www.marinmommies.com/calendar/santa-rosa-pumpkin-patch-19
