DESCRIPTION:Advance registration required” Saturday\, October 24 | 11:00
 am–1:00pm Experience the magic of plant colors!  Join us at Made Local
  Marketplace in Montgomery Village. Create a botanically printed piece usi
 ng fresh and dried plant parts. Use local dye flowers\, roots\, skins & an
  insect along with instruction to create a one of a kind bundle dyed scarf
  \\(11” x 60”\\). This workshop led by educator and natural dyer Lisa 
 Rogers\, will cover the basics of natural dyeing\, including fabric prepar
 ation and color modification.\n\nWorkshop fee includes all materials and i
 nstruction. Space is limited.\n\nDetails: • $80 per person • Max 15 
 participants • Duration: 2 hours\n\nImportant Notes: • Workshops requ
 ire a minimum of 4 participants • 72 hours notice required for a partial
  refund • Workshops are held outdoors but undercover at Made Local Marke
 tplace in Montgomery Village
LOCATION:Made Local Marketplace
