SUMMARY:Halloween at Howarth
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T150000
UID:260805FGF4Zu0SXUyqknQHijGdNg
DESCRIPTION:It's the 20th annual Halloween at Howarth! Dress in your best 
 costume and trick-or-treat throughout one of Santa Rosa's most popular par
 ks! Plus\, hop on Howarth Park's train and carousel with your costumed fri
 ends and catch a pony ride too! --- TIMES \\(register for one time slot\\)
  11:30am-12pm 12-12:30pm 12:30-1pm 1-1:30pm 1:30-2pm 2-2:30pm --- DETAILS 
 Children ages 12 and under will trick-or-treat through the park at treat s
 tations hosted by local Santa Rosa businesses and organizations and can th
 en enjoy Howarth Park's many other attractions. This year's Fun Zone will 
 include face painting\, a photo booth\, art & crafts and more! Rain may ca
 ncel the event\, check our Facebook page or call 707-543-3425 the morning 
 of the event for a status update. --- COST -$7 Basic Pass: includes trick-
 or-treating and access to the Fun Zone. -$25 Deluxe Pass: includes Basic P
 ass plus a train and carousel ride as well as a 1-lap pony ride. Deluxe Pa
 sses include two adult riders to accompany child on the train and carousel
  \\(must use Halloween Pass to ride\\). Additional adult riders will need 
 to purchase a ticket for $4 per person. -Please note: Train\, carousel\, a
 nd pony tickets are not included with the Basic Pass but can be purchased 
 at the train station the day of the event for $4 per person \\(train/carou
 sel\\) or $10 for a 1-lap pony ticket and $15 for a 2-lap pony ticket. ---
  PURCHASE TICKETS Passes may be purchased by calling 707-543-3737\, in per
 son at Finley Community Center \\(2060 W. College Ave.\\) or online here: 
 https://srcity.perfectmind.com/23508/Clients/BookMe4BookingPages/BookingCo
 ursesPage?calendarId=9a9aa21d-8599-4fee-9739-585e1f8b7f1e&widgetId=3dc0be8
 1-79e3-435b-b846-a48b644faa0a&embed=False&singleCalendarWidget=true It is 
 highly anticipated that this event will sell out\, so don't delay on secur
 ing your pass! --- ADDITIONAL QUESTIONS Email howarthpark@srcity.org or ca
 ll 707-543-3737.  Businesses! Want to Host a Trick-or-Treat Station? Conta
 ct us at howarthpark@srcity.org or call 707-543-3298
LOCATION:Howarth Memorial Park
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1914616182849826/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
