DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T170000
UID:260831lSQR3eFc50S0BvponPOK5w
DESCRIPTION:Cider Circus returns to Steamer Landing in Petaluma for a live
 ly celebration of all things apple. This one-of-a-kind festival brings tog
 ether Sonoma County producers and their international counterparts to show
 case low-intervention ciders\, co-ferments\, and liqueurs. Set along the P
 etaluma River in the heart of downtown\, the festival offers an afternoon 
 of delicious discoveries\, local flavor\, and wholesome revelry. Guests ca
 n arrive by car\, paddle\, train\, or bike and enjoy a unique riverside ex
 perience. Presented in partnership with Friends of the Petaluma River\, Ci
 der Circus welcomes supervised children and well-behaved dogs\, making it 
 a fun outing for the whole family.
LOCATION:Steamer Landing Park
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/cider-circus-at-steamer-landing/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
