BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.rionidoroadhouse.com/calendar", "Press Democrat": "https://www.rionidoroadhouse.com/calendar"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.rionidoroadhouse.com/calendar"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Fall Renaissance Faire at The Rio Nido Roadhouse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T170000
UID:261017HntGNfsFlUevdquNJI8piQ
DESCRIPTION:MUSIC • MISCHIEF • MERRIMENT\n\nLive Music!\n\nRebecca Rou
 dman - The fiddler of the Faire\n\nWren Story Duo - Minstrels of the Redwo
 ods\n\nJordan Walker - The Wandering Bard\n\nPOTION TRIALS\n\nYou're invit
 ed to submit an original potion recipe. It could be alcoholic or nonalcoho
 lic\, but the winning recipe becomes a featured Roadhouse cocktail/mocktai
 l.\n\nMust use reasonably accessible ingredients\, contain 5–6 ingredien
 ts maximum\, and have a Renaissance/fantasy-inspired name.\n\nThink names 
 like Dragon's Breath\, Fairy's Revenge\, The Enchanted Grove...etc.\n\nWe 
 will choose 3–4 finalists before the event.\n\nAt the Faire guests can b
 uy a Potion Flight and receive a voting ballot.\n\nWinner receives cash pr
 ize \\+ their potion featured on the Roadhouse cocktail menu.\n\nLIVE ACTI
 ON FENCING\n\nHARK! Prepare to witness a breathtaking spectacle of steel a
 nd strategy. Step back into the Golden Age of Chivalry as our troupe of ma
 ster duelists brings the heart-pounding reality of Renaissance fencing to 
 the live stage. No rehearsed dances or scripted fights—this is authentic
 \, high-speed\, live-action combat where experienced blades cross in real-
 time clashes of skill and honor. Find your seat at the list\, choose your 
 champion\, and prepare to be spellbound by the flash of the blade!\n\nENCH
 ANTED DANCERS OF THE REALM\n\nSeba and dancers from WildCard BellyDance. A
 n enchanting trio of music\, movement and merriment.\n\nPUMPKIN CARVING\, 
 DECORATING & CRAFTS\n\nFun for the whole family! Supplies and pumpkins pro
 vided.\n\nGAMES - PHOTO BOOTH BACKDROP - TURKEY LEG FEAST - LOCAL VENDING 
 -\n\nCOSTUMES ENCOURAGED!!\n\nAll Ages\n\n$5 Faire Admission
LOCATION:Rio Nido Roadhouse
URL:https://www.rionidoroadhouse.com/calendar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.courtneyrae.online/event-details/winter-prep-homemade-fire-cider"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Winter Prep: Homemade Fire Cider
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T150000
UID:260925A7CWQMYyf0i5Ua5aUeA9zw
DESCRIPTION:Vallejo People's Garden is hosting a fire cider making class\,
  facilitated by Courtney Rae of Moonlight Floreciendo and Jazzmin of Radic
 al Wellness 4 the Collective!\n\nJoin us to create and take home your own 
 fire cider. Learn how to make this simple yet powerful medicine just in ti
 me for the autumn and winter seasons!\n\nFire cider\, a term coined by Ros
 emary Gladstar\, is a spicy herbal tonic that brings together apple cider 
 vinegar\, herbs\, roots\, peppers\, seeds\, vegetables\, flowers\, and hon
 ey! It is a kitchen medicine that truly allows you to tap into your creati
 vity to promote health and wellness.\n\nDetails:\n\n🧅 Bring a clean 8oz
  glass jar with lid \\(mason jar or up-cycled jar\\)\n\n🫚 Equipment and
  ingredients are provided\; you’re also welcome to bring your own!\n\n
 🌶️ 15 spots available\n\n🍯 Sliding Scale\, starting at $15\n\nThis
  is a space for all\, regardless of your experience making herbal medicine
 s. We can't wait to see you there and make this powerful medicine together
 !\n\nTacos de la Milpa will be vending\, come early to enjoy their delicio
 us food!
LOCATION:Vallejo People's Garden
URL:https://www.courtneyrae.online/event-details/winter-prep-homemade-fire
 -cider
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
