 rom 2 to 7pm. Eight bands from Vallejo and across the Bay: The Love Bombs\
 , Shark in the Water\, Pinoles\, Eyes Out\, Knights of Molino\, Custody We
 ekend\, Step Up\, and Repossessor. Two scenes\, one afternoon\, and hostin
