DESCRIPTION:Get lifted\, get creative\, and leave with a masterpiece at **
 Mercy Presents: Creative with CAM**—an elevated art experience hosted by
  **Paint + Party Co.** and sponsored by **CAM**.\n\nLight up\, settle in\,
  and let your creativity flow as you're guided step-by-step through creati
 ng your own custom **8.5" x 11" glass frame**. No artistic experience? No 
 problem. Whether you're Picasso or just here for the sesh\, this workshop 
 is all about good vibes\, great company\, and having fun.\n\nYour ticket i
 ncludes:\n\n🎨 One 8.5" x 11" glass frame to paint and take home\n\n🖌
 ️ All paints\, brushes\, and art supplies\n\n✨ Easy-to-follow instruct
 ion from the talented team at Paint + Party Co.\n\n🌿 A **CAM goodie bag
  valued at over $60**\n\n💨 Full access to The Lounge at Mercy\, where y
 ou can enjoy your favorite cannabis products before\, during\, and after t
 he workshop\n\nExpect an afternoon filled with colorful creations\, elevat
 ed conversations\, and plenty of laughs. Grab your crew\, spark some inspi
 ration\, and discover why everything looks a little better after a sesh.\n
 \n**Seats are limited\, and this event is expected to sell out—reserve y
 ours today!**\n\n**Date & Time**\n\n**Date:** Saturday\, October 24\, 2026
 \n\n**Time:** 3:00 -5:00 PM\n\n**What’s Included**\n\nAll tools\, materi
 als\, and supplies are provided—just bring your creativity! \n\n**Ticke
 t Tiers**\n\n**11x14” Painting + CAM goodie bag — $60:** Includes 11x
 14" glass frame\, all paints and art supplies\, and step-by-step instructi
 on\, PLUS a goodie bag from CAM valued at over $60! \n\n21+ Only | DCC # 
 C12-0000420-LIC\n\n**Event Terms & Conditions**\n\nThis event is 21+ only.
  Valid government-issued ID is required for entry. By attending this event
  at the Mercy Wellness Lounge\, you acknowledge that photography and video
  recording may take place. Images and footage may be used by Mercy Wellnes
 s for marketing and promotional purposes across various channels\, without
  compensation. Tickets are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event d
 etails\, timing\, or programming are subject to change.\n\nCannabis consum
 ption is limited to designated areas and must comply with all applicable l
 ocal and state regulations. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the
  venue\, you agree to comply with all house rules and venue policies.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy 
URL:https://eventhi.io/events/mercy-presents-paint--party-with-cam-14912
