UID:261009AMLVgYNu_E6fIjeiNkW_7g
DESCRIPTION:Join us at The Bird Rescue Center as we explore the lives and 
 lore of our nocturnal and crepuscular native avian neighbors.\n\nAre you g
 etting your yard ready for the spooky season? We will cover bird friendly 
 decoration ideas and what you can do to protect birds in your yard.\n\nCre
 ate a fall themed bird feeder to share with your own backyard birds.\n\nAN
 D\n\nMeet our Ambassador Birds!
