SUMMARY:Mare Island Halloween Block Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T200000
UID:26092458bZPtpDDEeqwl9MV0HyWQ
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a frightfully fun adventure along the ghostly ch
 arm of Walnut Avenue and Officers Row\, with entrances near the mysterious
  Vino Godfather Mansion and Alden Park — now home to some spooky zombie 
 fun!\n\n🎃 This Halloween celebration has thrills and chills for every g
 houl and goblin in your family:\n\n🧟 NEW this year: Zombie fun has take
 n over Alden Park — perfect for photos and a little extra Halloween exci
 tement for the whole family.\n\n🍬 Little monsters can dive into bone-ch
 illing fun with trick-or-treating\, creative pumpkin decorating\, and magi
 cal face painting transformations.\n\n🐕 Four-legged friends are invited
  to the party! Our "Howl-o-ween" costume contest promises to be pawsitivel
 y exciting.\n\n🎵 Dance to our haunting playlist while savoring delectab
 le bites from our lineup of food trucks\, warming up with creamy hot choco
 late\, and enjoying a cauldron full of festive drinks.\n\nShow off your mo
 st creative costumes\, bring your favorite humans \\(and pets!\\)\, and pr
 epare for a monstrously memorable evening at this Halloween spectacular. 
 🦉🍁\n\nFREE ADMISSION – Just RSVP to secure your spot! All trick-or
 -treaters ages 13 & under receive a complimentary Halloween goodie bag whi
 le supplies last.
LOCATION:Walnut Avenue - Officer's Row\, Mare Island
URL:https://www.mareislandco.com/news-events/halloween2026
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://gathersebastopol.com/products/fresh-cheesemaking-with-botanical-flavors", "Press Democrat": "https://gathersebastopol.com/products/fresh-cheesemaking-with-botanical-flavors", "Sebastopol Calendar": "https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/fresh-cheesemaking-with-botanical-flavors/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://gathersebastopol.com/products/fresh-cheesemaking-with-botanical-flavors"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Fresh Cheesemaking with Botanical Flavors
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T180000
UID:261022WornvBgDL0S_EAJSrt1Giw
DESCRIPTION:Fresh cheese is one of the most approachable and rewarding thi
 ngs to make at home. In Sonoma County’s rich dairy landscape\, these sim
 ple cheeses have long been a staple—equally at home in everyday meals an
 d on a shared table.\n\nIn this hands-on workshop\, you’ll learn how to 
 make fresh cheeses from cow and goat milk\, while exploring how herbs\, fl
 owers\, and citrus can shape flavor in simple\, elegant ways. We’ll cove
 r the essential techniques behind fresh cheesemaking so you can confidentl
 y recreate them in your own kitchen.\n\nIn this workshop you’ll:\n\n• 
 Learn the fundamentals of fresh cheesemaking using cow and goat milk\n\n
 • Understand key concepts in cheesemaking\, including acidity\, texture
 \, and food safety\n\n• Make goat milk chèvre with edible flowers and w
 ith rosemary and honey\n\n• Prepare fresh ricotta with Meyer lemon\n\n
 • Explore how to incorporate herbs\, flowers\, and other botanicals int
 o your cheeses\n\nYou’ll work alongside instructor Willow\, a Sonoma Cou
 nty farmer and educator\, whose approach connects practical kitchen skills
  with a deeper understanding of ingredients and process.\n\nYou’ll leave
  with recipes\, techniques\, and the confidence to begin making fresh chee
 se at home.\n\nNo prior cheesemaking experience required.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://gathersebastopol.com/products/fresh-cheesemaking-with-botanica
 l-flavors
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Sebastopol Calendar
END:VEVENT
