DESCRIPTION:Little ones can enjoy a \\(not too\\) spooky time at our Hallo
 ween Kids Night Out!\n\nFor this fun and active Saturday event\, you can d
 rop off your little monsters at the gym at 4:30 PM\, and we’ll keep them
