 ntime.\n\nWe’ll play games\, watch a movie\, and eat a tasty dinner\, al
 l included in the price. Costumes are encouraged!\n\nYou can register thro
 ugh our FullOut portal \\(account creation required\\)\, OR you can give u
 s a call at 707-343-1402\, and we’ll get you all signed up over the phon
 e.\n\nThe cost is just $60 per child for 4 hours of glow-in-the-dark\, mon
 strous fun!\n\nSpots are limited\, so sign up today.
