DESCRIPTION:Dawn Angelosante’s \\(piano\\) voice wraps lyrics into a dre
 amscape of sound and story\, touching on love\, friendship\, heartbreak\, 
 and self-reflection. Tony Gibson’s \\(guitar\\) songwriting blends infec
 tious melodies with honest\, emotionally resonant lyrics. His music feels 
 familiar and fresh.  Michael Fecskes \\(cello\\)\, a classically trained c
 ellist and composer\, adds a unique depth to the group’s sound.  His com
 positions are rich and soulful.\n\nTogether\, they form The Northern Still
 \, a dynamic acoustic/folk-pop trio. Since 2021 they’ve combined their i
 ndividual voices and musical influences into a lush\, intimate sound\, wit
 h haunting vocal harmonies. Whether performing original compositions or th
 eir fresh takes on covers\, they’ve captivated audiences throughout the 
 North Bay.
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern
