DESCRIPTION:Mírame Entertainment is thrilled to bring back our 4th Annual
  Divas de Los Muertos Drag Party on Saturday\, October 24th! This year\, w
 e are doubling the magic by hosting this drag and dance experience across 
 two of our favorite venues in Orcutt: Naughty Oak and Lark & Sparrow! Diva
 s de los Muertos is hosted by the incredible Missy Vee\, with performances
  by Nova Cane\, Divinity Za\, and BJ Queen! As the veil thins\, our iconic
  drag performers will channel the spirits of legendary music icons who hav
 e passed—bringing unforgettable divas back to life.  Enjoy your soundtra
 ck for the night with sets by the incredible DJ Suz and DJ Kariii. Plus\, 
 we have even more surprises in store that you'll have to see to believe! J
 oin us for a night of drag\, dance\, delicious drinks\, and a celebration 
 that honors our past and present. At Divas de los Muertos\, we celebrate a
 ll people and all souls\, and we can't wait to see you there! ¡Vamos a ce
 lebrar! \\*Please note that this is a standing-room event\, and seating is
  not guaranteed.
