DESCRIPTION:A night celebrating the alt-rock of the ’90s and early 2000s
  at HopMonk Novato.\n\nCrystal Ballers brings a high-energy live show pack
 ed with music from Nirvana\, Rage Against the Machine\, Stone Temple Pilot
 s\, Weezer\, Radiohead\, Alice in Chains\, 311\, Green Day and more.\n\nJo
 ining them are longtime Marin musician Susan Z and her band Lilith Affair\
 , celebrating the women and music of the ’90s with songs inspired by the
  artists and spirit of Lilith Fair.\n\nBig guitars\, huge songs and plenty
  to sing along to. Come out and celebrate one of the greatest eras of rock
  music.
