BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "http://soperreesetheatre.com"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Lake County Theatre Company - Little Shop of Horrors
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T210000
UID:2610233r0EFMpJqk2WugCpOudpoA
DESCRIPTION:**It was a B movie in the sixties. Then it was a hit off-broad
 way musical in the 80s. Soon after it was a hit musical movie\, and it has
  dazzled audiences ever since. Lake County Theatre Company and Mendocino C
 ollege present Little Shop of Horrors\, by Howard Ashman and Alan Menken. 
 This sensational musical will have you tapping your feet and laughing all 
 night long. This romantic comedy set in a florist’s shop on Skid Row wil
 l surely grow on you.**\n\n**October 16th through November 1 at the Soper 
 Reese Theatre in Lakeport. Tickets are available on the Soper Reese websit
 e.**
