SUMMARY:Phil Johnson and Roadside Attraction Comedy and Music
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T193000
UID:2610206K2VTjXplUaGTEcelcppaA
DESCRIPTION:Headlining!\n\nPhil Johnson delivers a high-energy comedy expe
 rience that blends stand-up and live music. With a sharp eye for the absur
 d\, he tackles topics like American exceptionalism\, body image\, conspira
 cy culture\, and the general weirdness of modern life — all from the vie
 wpoint of a guy who happily grew up in the deeply multi-everything communi
 ty of the San Francisco Bay Area.\n\nHis material is smart\, satirical\, a
 nd unafraid to ask bigger questions while still chasing the laugh.\n\nPhil
  has performed at the Sundance Film Festival and Edinburgh Fringe Festival
 \, his stand-up tracks air on SiriusXM Radio\, and he's been heard on Bob 
 & Tom Radio and seen on Amazon Prime. He has released four comedy specials
  and multiple albums and singles\, showcasing a signature blend of tightly
  written jokes\, catchy \\(and occasionally naughty\\) songs\, and a perfo
 rmer's instinct for balancing insight with irreverence.
LOCATION:Trek Winery
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108869223?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://raventheater.org/events/sweeney-todd/", "Press Democrat": "https://raventheater.org/events/sweeney-todd/"}
