X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/joose-halloween-bash-1024-p253.aspx", "Press Democrat": "https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/joose-halloween-bash-1024-p253.aspx"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/joose-halloween-bash-1024-p253.aspx"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:90s Halloween Bash with JOOSE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T200000
UID:261022kqjnV3HRCEuvDpYD2K2OnA
DESCRIPTION:**Date:** Saturday\, October 24\, 2026\n\n**Time:** Doors 7 
 PM | Show 8 PM\n\n**Tickets:** $20 Advance | $30 Door | Coyote Sonoma Clu
 b Members Receive $5 Off\n\n**Food Vendor:** Mamadio's Philly Cheesesteaks
 \n\nGet your scare on and celebrate this Halloween with us at Coyote Sonom
 a with beloved local 90s rock cover band\, JOOSE. Jam out to killer hits f
 rom the 80's\, 90's & 2000's and enjoy our wide selection of wine and beer
  specials.\n\n**JOOSE** is a high-energy ‘**90s rock tribute band** de
 dicated to resurrecting the golden era of alternative and grunge. From the
  brooding depths of Seattle grunge to the pop-rock chart-toppers of the de
 cade\, our setlist is a time capsule of songs that defined a generation.\n
 \nFormed by a group of seasoned musicians with a passion for all things 
 ‘90s\, JOOSE channels the raw emotion and dynamic energy of bands like N
 irvana\, Pearl Jam\, Smashing Pumpkins\, Green Day\, Foo Fighters\, and mo
 re. Each performance is a nostalgic journey back to a time when flannel ru
 led\, MTV played music videos\, and rock music spoke to the heart of the c
 ulture.\n\nWith authentic instrumentation\, dynamic vocals\, and a stage p
 resence that captures the spirit of the era\, **JOOSE is more than a trib
 ute – it’s a full-on revival**. Whether you're rocking out to grunge c
 lassics or swaying to iconic ballads\, we’ll transport you back to the d
 ays of Discman players and cassette mixtapes.\n\nGet ready to relive the a
 ngst\, the anthems\, and the attitude. JOOSE is your backstage pass to the
  ‘90s rock experience you’ll never forget!
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma
URL:https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/joose-halloween-bash-1024-p253.aspx
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
