X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sebastopol Center for the Arts": "https://www.sebarts.org/classes-lectures/ultra-textural-weaving-on-a-unique-substrate-with-vicki-assegued-october-25th-2026"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sebarts
SUMMARY:Ultra Textural Weaving on a Unique Substrate with Vicki Assegued (
 October 25th\, 2026) — Sebastopol Center For the Arts\, California
DTSTART:20261025T000000
DTEND:20261026T000000
UID:24271be0e3e73e2cf3ace9cf188a4615@sebarts.org
DESCRIPTION:Out of Stock\n      \n    \n\n\n\n\n\nUltra Textural Weaving o
 n a Unique Substrate with Vicki Assegued (October 25th\, 2026)\n\n  \n    
 \n      \n      from $125.00\n    \n  \n\nRegister early to qualify for ou
 r $25.00 off early-bird registration rate!Use code VCK-EARLYBIRD-1025 unti
 l September 25th to claim your discountUltra Textural Weaving on a Unique 
 SubstrateInstructor: Vicki Assegued Where: Sebastopol Center for the Arts 
 When: Sunday\, October 25th - 10:00am-3:00pmPrice: $100 registration + $25
  Materials Fee Class Description: You’ll learn many techniques for weavi
 ng\, knotting\, wrapping\, tying\, sewing\, coiling and twisting of fiber 
 materials to build our dynamic and stunning pieces to hang on the wall.The
  surprising and versatile foundation for the weaving is plastic fencing\, 
 which opens the creative journey into much more than ordinary weaving.You'
 ll have access to plastic fencing\, many gorgeous fabrics and yarns\, bead
 s\, buttons and other decorations to add to your piece.You’ll also make 
 fringe\, tassels and pompoms to add texture and delight. No art or weaving
  experience is necessary\, and all levels are most welcome.(If you've take
 n Vicki's other weaving workshop\, please note that this will be a very di
 fferent workshop\, with plenty of new techniques to learn and outcomes to 
 explore).Please bring: Sewing needle and thread\, Fabric Scissors (If you 
 have them)Optional: You’re encouraged to bring materials from your own s
 tash including fabrics\, used clothing\, yarn\, string\, lace\, ribbon\, b
 eads\, old jewelry parts and other decorations.Feel Inspired? Join all thr
 ee of Vicki’s upcoming classes for $15.00 off each class\, and save $25 
 in materials!Sunday Oct 25\, 2026 - Ultra Textural Weaving on a Unique Sub
 strate Sunday Dec 13\, 2026 - Stuffed and Decorated Vessels Saturday Jan
  30\, 2027 - Fibers Beyond the FrameAbout the Instructor: Vicki Assegued i
 s an experimental and innovative fiber artist and instructor\, always find
 ing new and unique ways to work with textiles and fibers. Through her crea
 tive process\, she explores many ways to weave\, layer\, attach\, coil\, t
 ie\, knot\, twist\, build and develop her pieces so they are vibrant and e
 ngaging. She then shares all of her techniques with her students\, support
 ing and inspiring them to fully engage in their own creative process of di
 scovery and expression. Vicki teaches at art schools and retreats around t
 he country\, such as the Art & Soul Mixed Media Retreat\, the Mendocino Ar
 t Center\, North Country Studio Workshops and the San Jose Museum of Quilt
 s & Textiles. Vicki completed a 4-month residency with the Santa Cruz Recy
 cled Art Program. She has exhibited and sold her work at galleries\, busin
 esses\, health centers\, restaurants\, community centers\, museums\, and o
 pen studio events. You can learn more about Vicki here: https://www.vickia
 rt.com/\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                  Single Class or Series?:\n       
          \n\n\n\n                      Select Single Class or Series?\n   
                  \nOnly Ultra Textural Weaving on a Unique Substrate\nAll 
 Three Classes!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          \n  
           \n              \n                Add to cart
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts\, 282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA 
 95472
URL:https://www.sebarts.org/classes-lectures/ultra-textural-weaving-on-a-u
 nique-substrate-with-vicki-assegued-october-25th-2026
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Center for the Arts
END:VEVENT
