DESCRIPTION:Community pancake breakfast-It’s a great opportunity to get to know one another\, meet our firefighters and staff and enjoy breakfast together. We encourage people to ask questions\, share concerns\, and talk with us about fire safety and emergency preparedness. Most of all\, we hope everyone will stop by\, have some pancakes\, and spend the morning with us.
