DESCRIPTION:Santa Rosa Pumpkin Patch offers eight acres of pumpkins\, a hu
 ge seven-acre corn maze\, kiddy corn mazes\, hay and sunflower mazes\, jac
 k-o-lantern tether ball\, tire swings\, a 10-bale-high hay pyramid\, a hug
 e jumpy pillow\, pedal trike races\, a corn play box\, a petting zoo\, fac
 e painting\, children's entertainers\, pony rides \\(weekends only\\)\, ha
 y rides\, yummy treats and food\, birthday parties\, field trips\, group t
 ours\, and more. Purchase acitivity wristbands for unlimited access to att
 ractions.  Read our review of Santa Rosa Pumpkin Patch .
LOCATION:Santa Rosa Pumpkin Patch 5157 Stony Point Road
