DESCRIPTION:Join Dolphin Charters for a 3 hr narrated trip on the Petaluma
  River. View the commercial aspects of this waterway as we depart the Peta
 luma Turning Basin\, head downriver\, and enter a different world of wetla
 nds and oxbows. Learn about the history and importance of the river to the
  town of Petaluma and the surrounding countryside\, and why it is still im
 portant today.  Look around you to see the birds and wildlife that inhabi
 t this special region as we cruise on our downriver and return journey. Ch
 ildren must be 8 years of age or older and cost is $55/person
