UID:2610203eRRmhFoWkCPYU4l2nwgiQ
DESCRIPTION:Healing Hearts by JassverArt is more than a paint class - it's
  a creative experience designed to help you relax\, reconnect\, and create
  from the heart. Begin with a gentle guided meditation\, then paint your o
 wn beautiful wooden heart with step-by-step instruction. No experience is 
 necessary - just bring an open heart. Gather with friends\, enjoy the beau
 tiful atmosphere at Vino Godfather Winery\, and leave with a one-of-a-kind
  piece of art and a peaceful heart.\n\nWhile painting\, enjoy music by Key
  Lime Pie performing 1-4pm. \\*Music included with Sip & Paint admission.\
 n\nYour first glass of wine\, of your choice\, is included with admission.
  All art supplies will be provided. Bring your own protective covering if 
 you'd like. Charcuterie items and other snacks will be available for purch
 ase\, along with additional wine by the glass or bottle. There will be a s
 hort break to replenish drinks and grab snacks.\n\nFood: Delicious Dishez 
 will be serving up Cajun Cuisine: southern fried chicken\, fried fish\, sh
 rimp\, fresh hand cut chicken tenders\, sticky icky wings\, gourmet Mac n 
 cheese\, collard greens\, seasoned fries\, and hush puppies!\n\nSpace is l
 imited to 20 guests. Class will take place in backyard venue\, dress accor
 dingly\, evenings can be cool.
LOCATION:Vino Godfather
URL:https://events.vinogodfather.com/healing-hearts-3/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108708002?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=287&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event"}
