UID:261015yydOSV-n9Ee0eWQ4YKF-cg
DESCRIPTION:Let your creativity burn! Join us inside The Lounge at Mercy f
 or an afternoon of crafting\, chill vibes\, and good company. This month w
 e're trinket-maxxing and making our own Bong Charms and Tote Bag Charms. B
 ring your own tote bag or purse to decorate\, or grab a new bag from one o
 f our Mercy brand partners to customize!\n\nBe ready for beading\, rhinest
 ones\, fabric paint and more. Come for the crafts\, stay for the vibes. Cr
 aft\, chill\, and express yourself — Mercy style.\n\nDate & Time\n\nDate
 : Sunday\, October 25\, 2026\n\nTime: 3:00 - 6:00 PM\n\nWhat’s Included\
 n\nAll craft supplies\n\nGood vibes\n\nA cannabis-friendly lounge to spark
  your creativity\n\nTicket Tiers\n\n$20 - EARLY BIRD GA: All supplies prov
 ided. Early bird pricing while supplies last. \n\n$25 - General Admission
 : All materials and supplies included.\n\n$30 - Crafting \\+ Sesh Starter 
 \\(Joint\\) - All materials and supplies included plus enjoy a 1g preroll 
 to kick off your sesh while you create.\n\n$35 - Crafting \\+ Sesh Starter
  \\(Extract\\) - All materials and supplies included plus one 1g concentra
 te for guests who want a stronger lift while they craft and chill.\n\n$35 
 - Crafting \\+ Sesh Starter \\(Flower\\) - All materials and supplies incl
 uded and enjoy 1g of flower to elevate the creative session.\n\n$35 - Craf
 ting \\+ Sesh Starter \\(Vape\\) - All materials and supplies included plu
 s an all-in-one vape to enjoy during the event.\n\n⭐ $50 - Crafting \\+
  Flower Flight - All materials and supplies included plus a 3-gram flower 
 tasting flight \\(three 1g selections\\) to explore while you craft and ch
 ill.\n\n21\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12-0000420-LIC\n\nEvent Terms & Conditions\n
 \nThis event is 21\\+ only. Valid government-issued ID is required for ent
 ry. By attending this event at the Mercy Wellness Lounge\, you acknowledge
  that photography and video recording may take place. Images and footage m
 ay be used by Mercy Wellness for marketing and promotional purposes across
  various channels\, without compensation. Tickets are non-refundable unles
 s otherwise stated. Event details\, timing\, or programming are subject to
  change.\n\nCannabis consumption is limited to designated areas and must c
 omply with all applicable local and state regulations. Please consume resp
 onsibly.\n\nBy entering the venue\, you agree to comply with all house rul
 es and venue policies.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://eventhi.io/events/mercy-presents-craft-and-chill-102526-15198
