DESCRIPTION:Sing\, Laugh\, Defend Democracy\n\nJoin us Sunday\, October 25
  at 3:00 PM for an entertaining and thought-provoking afternoon in support
  of independent community radio. Roy Zimmerman brings his signature blend 
 of political satire\, hilarious storytelling\, and memorable original song
 s to the Inn at Occidental for a special benefit performance supporting KO
 WS Community Radio.With humor that is incisive\, timely\, and hopeful\, Ro
 y takes on politics\, social justice\, and the state of democracy—inviti
 ng audiences to sing\, laugh\, and leave a little more inspired. "Roy's ly
 rics move beyond poetry and achieve perfection\," said Joni Mitchell.
LOCATION:The Inn at Occidental
URL:https://www.innatoccidental.com/roy/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
