SUMMARY: Pilot Parallel Pen Demonstration: Beyond the Basics
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Juanita Watkins\nDate: Sunday\, October 25th\nTim
 e: 12:00PM-2:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Location\nFree!\n\n\nJoin local a
 rtist and calligrapher Juanita Watkins for this valuable demonstration th
 at will introduce participants to advanced techniques for creating art an
 d lettering with Pilot Parallel Pens. She will discuss how to create mult
 icolored lettering by touching pens. You will learn how to create shimmer
 ing gold ink effects using Finetec Gold and other Finetec colors\, and ho
 w to use a Parallel Pen to ink a pointed dip pen to add fine lines and ot
 her effects. Other topics will include the unusual properties of various 
 inks\, how to fill your parallel pen with various fountain pen inks\, how
  to completely dismantle and clean a Parallel Pen\, and Cadel Lettering.\
 n\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Calligraphy
