SUMMARY:Cases in Echocardiography\, Cardiac CT\, and MRI
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T120000
UID:25121882rNSWAJKkaTrinN3jJDeA
DESCRIPTION:The program consists primarily of clinical cases which illustr
 ate the problems cardiovascular specialists commonly encounter. Multiple c
 hoice questions addressing the clinical utility and limitations of echocar
 diography follow each case. Utilization of cardiac CT and MRI is also inco
 rporated into the cases. In addition\, faculty presents “rapid fire” a
 nd “unknown” cases.\n\nSpecial breakout sessions are devoted to the in
 terpretation of Doppler hemodynamics\, stress echocardiography\, multimoda
 lity imaging\, and congenital heart disease.\n\nDate and Time: Mon\, 26 Oc
 t 2026 07:00 - Wed\, 28 Oct 2026 12:00\n\nVenue details: The Meritage Reso
 rt and Spa\, 875 Bordeaux Way\, Napa\, California\, 94558\, United States
LOCATION:The Meritage Resort and Spa
URL:https://go.evvnt.com/3391554-2?pid=6630
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
