DESCRIPTION:Join Hanna Center at the Sonoma Golf Club on October 26 for th
 e 27th Annual Golf Classic! Featuring 18 holes of play\, on-course games\,
  lunch and an awards ceremony in support of Hanna Center’s community pro
 gramming\, this is a cherished local event.  \n\nThe day begins with reg
 istration and breakfast at 8:30 AM\, followed by a shotgun start at 10:00 
 AM. Lunch and awards will take place at 3:00 PM. Fun and games on the gree
 n include Puttskee\, Drive Accuracy\, Longest Drive\, Buy a Drive\, Closes
 t to the Pin\, and more! All proceeds from the Golf Classic support Hanna 
 Center’s recreational programming\, which offers opportunities to Sonoma
  residents of all ages and backgrounds. \n\nA variety of tax-deductible s
 ponsorship opportunities are available for individuals and groups. Tax-Ded
 uctible sponsorships are available now. To register or explore sponsorship
  options\, visit https://hannacenter.org/calendar/27th-annual-golf-classic
 /
LOCATION:Sonoma Golf Club 
URL:https://hannacenter.org/calendar/27th-annual-golf-classic/
