 ractive 2-hour class\, Anna O’Neil—garden enthusiast\, aromatherapist\
 , and aspiring folk herbalist—will guide you in crafting these time-hono
 red tonics from scratch using fresh\, organic ingredients. You’ll learn 
 the history\, health benefits\, and delicious ways to use Fire Cider and H
 erbal Vinegars in your kitchen and self-care rituals.\n\nLeave with your o
 wn custom blends and recipes to keep the tradition alive at home. Connect\
