 n\nJoin this online phone banking session to contact SD350 members and tel
 l them to vote early\, vote securely\, and support our priority ballot mea
 sures.\n\nWe'll have a call list\, phone script and sample voice mail. You
 'll need your own laptop/computer and cell phone \\(or google voice \\#\\)
  to make calls. You can also contact friends and family because this is al
 l about getting folks to actually vote.\n\nYou'll receive a link to the zo
 om meeting when you register.\n\nTickets:  .
