DESCRIPTION:Bring a project and meet new people who share your hobbies at 
 the JFK Library Sewing Circle! This event is held in the Makerspace. We ha
 ve some sewing machines and sergers\, but you are welcome to bring your ow
 n if you prefer. Please register if you would like to use one of our machi
 nes. This is a social club and there will be no instruction. We have sewin
 g workshops almost every month\, so please check the calendar for those ev
 ents. Available Supplies and Machinery: Fabric Scraps Thread Rulers Fabric
  Shears Pins Seam rippers Iron Sewing Machines Sergers Registration is not
  required unless you would like to use one of the library's sewing machine
 s. If you intend to bring your own machine\, or plan to work on a hand-sew
 ing project\, you do not need to register even if the event is full. If yo
 u reserve a machine but cannot arrive within the first 10 minutes of the p
 rogram\, please call us at \\(866\\) 572-7587\, \\(ext 41\\) to let us kno
 w you are still coming. If you do not\, we will allow walk-in attendees to
  use the machines.
LOCATION:Vallejo John F. Kennedy Library
URL:https://solanolibrary.libnet.info/event/15677837
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
