BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/cumbia/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:4
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T193000
UID:2610236jSJmxame0-HHFAMBRHyQg
DESCRIPTION:4-week\, Tuesdays at 6:30 PM\n\nOCTOBER 27 – NOVEMBER 17\n\n
 Feel the Rhythm with Cumbia\n\nReady to master the “Step of the Soul”?
  Join us for a high-energy cumbia class where we dive into the heart of La
 tin America’s most infectious dance. Whether you have two left feet or y
 ou’re a dance floor regular\, this class will get you moving with confid
 ence.\n\nMireille will guide you through:\n\n4-Week Beginner Cumbia Series
  Program\n\nWeek 1 – Foundations & Rhythm\n\n• Introduction to cumbia 
 music and timing\n\n• Basic steps \\( tropical and sonidera basics \\)\n
 \n• Understanding the beat \\( quick quick slow – quick quick slow \\)
 \n\n• Intro to partner connection \\(closed/open hold\\) ⸻\n\nWeek 2 
 – Footwork Development \\+ cumbia Basic Turns\n\n• Review of basic ste
 p\n\n• Cumbia prep for turns\n\n• Traveling basics \\(moving around th
 e floor\\)\n\n• Intro to basic cumbia turns .\n\n• Partner timing and 
 frame basics\, partner work combination. ⸻\n\nWeek 3 – Styling & Partn
 er Patterns\n\n• Review turns\n\n• Adding simple styling \\(arm moveme
 nt\, body rhythm\\)\n\n• Cross-body lead variation \\(beginner-friendly\
 \)\n\n• Smooth transitions between moves\n\n. Partner work combination. 
 ⸻\n\nWeek 4 – Putting It All Together\n\n• Review all footwork and p
 atterns\n\n• Combining moves into a short sequence\n\n• Musicality: da
 ncing with the music\n\n• Confidence and flow on the dance floor\n\n• 
 Social dancing practice \\+ mini recap\n\nImportant Details\n\nNo dance ex
 perience required: Whether you’ve never danced before or it’s been a w
 hile\, you’re welcome here!\n\nNo partner necessary: Come solo or bring 
 a friend—either way\, you’ll have plenty of opportunities to dance.\n\
 nPlease wear non-marking shoe soles: This helps us keep our dance floor in
  great condition.\n\nCome join us and discover the joy of cumbia. We can
 ’t wait to see you on the dance floor.\n\nDate & Time: Tuesdays \, 6:30 
 pm\n\n4 week course\, OCTOBER 27 – NOVEMBER 17\n\nInstructor: Mireille R
 uiz Born and raised in Mexico City\, she grew up dancing and listening to 
 Latin Music as part of her culture including Cumbia\, Banda\, ranchera\, q
 uebradita\, etc. she learned her first following Techniques\, dancing with
  her father in every family fiesta. she has a background in Mexican folklo
 re\, Jazz\, tap dancing and gymnastics\, she also is a percussionist\, dru
 mmer and Montessori Teacher.\n\nShe grew up performing since she the age o
 f 4. Bay Area bachata and cumbia dance instructor\, Mireille has been teac
 hing dance\, performing\, leading dance teams\, around USA events\, dance 
 festivals\, congresses since 2008\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8 Sa
 n Rafael\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor marking shoe sol
 es allowed.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/cumbia/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
