SUMMARY: Beginning Watercolor Class
DESCRIPTION:Discover the joy of Watercolor Painting!\n\nUnlock your creat
 ivity with our Beginning Watercolor Class\, designed for beginners and ad
 vanced beginners alike! Dive into the vibrant world of watercolor and mas
 ter the techniques to create stunning artwork.\n\n\n\n\n\nCourse Details:
 \n\n  * Instructor: Eva Mautner\n  * Fee: $60 per class or $220 for 4 cla
 sses\n  * Days & Times: Wednesdays & Fridays\, 10:30 AM - 12:30 PM\n  * S
 AN RAFAEL LOCATION ONLY\n\nLearning Objectives:\n\n  * Get acquainted wit
 h basic watercolor materials and tools\n  * Master the ‘wet on wet’ water
 color technique\n  * Learn the fundamentals of layering color and creatin
 g shadows\n  * Build confidence and find joy in the creative process\n  *
  Create and label a swatch of colors\n  * Practice layering color with a 
 grid exercise\n  * Proper brush care and maintenance\n  * Learn to correc
 t mistakes and know when to leave them\n  * Masking border edges for clea
 n finishes\n  * Develop tight underdrawings to guide your work\n  * Navig
 ate the entire painting process\, from choosing colors to building layers
 \n\nKey Skills You'll Gain:\n\n  * Selecting and using brushes\n  * Layer
 ing and drying techniques\n  * Building and placing colors effectively\n 
  * Understanding complementary colors\n  * Capturing shapes and light in 
 your work\n  * Creating solid underdrawings\n  * Applying wet-on-wet tech
 niques\n\nJoin us and experience the satisfaction of producing your own w
 atercolor masterpieces. Register now and save with our early registration
  discount!\n\nFor more information or to register for this class\, please
  contact Eva at: evamautner@gmail.com mailto:evamautner@gmail.com mailto:
 evamautner@gmail.com\n\nYou can also visit Eva's website at: http://evama
 utner.com http://evamautner.com evamautner.com\n\nLet's make beautiful ar
 t together!
CATEGORIES:San-Rafael,Watercolor,Creativity,Painting,Technique,Color
