SUMMARY:The Healing Plate
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T193000
UID:261012DI2EecKdmEWhnAYyGXAbhA
DESCRIPTION:The Healing Plate is a medically run and tailored group cookin
 g class offered for free through Touro University California and their Stu
 dent Run Free Clinic. Sessions are run by a medical provider and medical s
 tudents. Participants will learn how to better manage chronic conditions s
 uch as diabetes or high cholesterol using food as medicine. Participants c
 ook each week and enjoy a meal together. Participants MUST sign-up ahead o
 f time using the number or email provided.
LOCATION:Norman C King Community Center
