BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://cei.sonoma.edu/first-contact"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:"People of the West" Screening\, Talk & Nature Walk
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T200000
UID:261022fk7D-JOIaU-zruJa_kSGPg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for another "People of the West: An Indigenous History
  of California" episode screening\, then take some time to connect with ea
 ch other and the outdoors. In "First Contact\," we hear how\, before colon
 ization\, California was a world of ceremony\, sovereignty\, and sacred ba
 lance\; then everything changed. Come explore how Indigenous worldviews re
 flect relationships to land\, responsibility\, and sovereignty\, and analy
 ze how first contact with Spanish explorers disrupted—but did not erase
 —Indigenous continuity. Following the presentation and discussion\, part
 icipants will have the opportunity to take part in a gentle walk along the
  Copeland Creek Trail to the Native Plant Garden\, where we can rest and r
 eflect with nature.
LOCATION:SSU Wine Spectator Learning Center\, Copeland Creek Corridor\, Na
 tive Plant Garden
URL:https://cei.sonoma.edu/first-contact
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://solanolibrary.libnet.info/event/17485749"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Cosmic Connections
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T190000
UID:261009Oi1qZ2KI-0evymlGTlH79w
DESCRIPTION:What happens inside a black hole? Could we ever travel through
  time? Why is quantum physics so strange? And what questions have you alwa
 ys wanted to ask a physicist?\n\nJoin us for a relaxed evening of conversa
 tion and audience Q&A with local physicists. No science background require
 d—just curiosity. \n\nRecent advances in technology and science have ex
 panded our understanding of the Cosmos. With each new answer comes a new l
 ist of questions. UC Davis scientists Lloyd Knox and Markus Luty are bring
 ing their knowledge and expertise on the road for a traveling conversation
  called Cosmic Connections. \n\nKinetic Energy mocktails will be served w
 ith quantum cookies. This program is geared towards adults and inquisitive
  teens.
LOCATION:Springstowne Library
URL:https://solanolibrary.libnet.info/event/17485749
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
