SUMMARY:Glow & Ghouls: Free Halloween Glow Workout
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T204500
UID:261018qFi7Ir_pQkelcgKNrgHdzg
DESCRIPTION:Turn off the lights. Turn up the energy. On Thursday\, October
  29\, Culture Fitness in Rohnert Park is switching off the regular lights 
 and switching on the black lights for Glow & Ghouls\, a free Halloween glo
 w-in-the-dark workout. Pick the 7:00 PM or the 8:00 PM session.\n\nIt's fr
 ee and open to everyone. You don't need to be a member. It's a coach-led g
 roup workout and every movement can be scaled\, so bring a friend. If this
  is your first time in a gym\, you'll fit right in.\n\nWear white or neon 
 so you glow\, or come in a costume you can move in. Your coaches will be i
 n costume too. Glow sticks\, bracelets and necklaces are on us.\n\nSave yo
 ur spot: https://landingpage1.culturefitness.fit/glow-and-ghouls
