 ng journey filled with wonder. Along the adventure\, she encounters Jack a
 nd the Beanstalk’s sassy cow\, an out of pocket Pirate and the secret sa
 crifice of the cricket and the wren. Featuring aerialists\, jugglers\, kni
 fe throwers\, and laugh out loud comedy\, this circus blends classic story
 book archetypes with imaginative new heroes. The Cricket and the Wren will
  surprise\, dazzle and delight all ages. In addition to the family friendl
