X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://raventheater.org/events/sweeney-todd/", "Press Democrat": "https://raventheater.org/events/sweeney-todd/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://raventheater.org/events/sweeney-todd/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Sweeney Todd
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T193000
UID:260909Q19XwVtMsUS5YcXzn5VrRA
DESCRIPTION:Sweeney Todd is largely considered one of Stephen Sondheim’s
  masterpieces. With it\, he aimed to create a musical that could “scare 
 the hell out of everyone\,” and yet\, somehow\, be funny.\n\nThe story c
 enters around Sweeney Todd\, an unjustly exiled barber who returns to Lond
 on\, seeking vengeance against the lecherous judge who framed him and rava
 ged his young wife. The road to revenge leads Todd to Mrs. Lovett\, a reso
 urceful proprietress of a failing pie shop\, above which\, he opens a new 
 barber practice. Mrs. Lovett’s luck sharply shifts when Todd’s thirst 
 for blood inspires the integration of an ingredient into her meat pies tha
 t has the people of 19th Century London lining up…and the carnage has on
 ly just begun!\n\n\\***Content Advisory:** Adult language and violent the
 mes\, as well as controversial pie recipes. Recommended for 12+.\n\nRunnin
 g Time: 2 hours\, 40 minutes including one intermission.\n\nOctober 23rd\,
  24th\, 25th\, \\*29th\, 30th\, 31st\, Nov 1st\, 6th\, 7th\, 8th.\n\nBook 
 by Hugh Wheeler\n\nMusic and Lyrics by Stephen Sondheim\n\nDirected by Ste
 ven David Martin\n\n**Friday and Saturday Shows:** 7:30 PM\n\n**Sunday Mat
 inee:** 2:00 PM\n\n**\\*Value Thursday:** 7:30 PM\n\n**Admission:** \n\nA
 dults: $44\n\nStudent w/ID: $10\n\n\\*Special Value Thursday Performanc
 e: Pay What You Can
LOCATION:The Raven Performing Arts Theater
URL:https://raventheater.org/events/sweeney-todd/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://signup.com/go/WiniixA"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Gain Speaking Confidence with Mare Island Toastmasters
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T203000
UID:261020ceepm9Q2hkmGnfHvzlsV5A
DESCRIPTION:We meet in-person only on the 1st and 2nd Thursdays of the mon
 th. However\, you can catch us online every Thursday unless the meeting da
 te falls on a holiday.\n\nPlease register at https://signup.com/go/WiniixA
 \n\nWhat is Toastmasters About?\n\nUsually at our meetings\, we will have 
 a prepared speech\, and a speech evaluation. The Grammarian and Wizard of 
 Ah's will listen for turns of phrases and the use of filler words. We also
  practice impromptu speaking during the section of the meeting called Tabl
 e Topics. During Table Topics\, at a recent meeting\, we were asked what w
 e felt was the biggest communication problem or challenge. What would you 
 answer in a fast moment? Table topics will challenge you to think quickly 
 and give an answer without preparation.\n\nYou will also hear tips on publ
 ic speaking skills at our upcoming meeting. Whether you're a seasoned trav
 eler or just looking for some adventure from the comfort of your home\, th
 is event is perfect for you.\n\nToastmasters International is all about co
 mmunication excellence\, and for 100 years and counting\, Toastmasters hav
 e been expressing themselves better\, practicing\, and evaluating in a fun
  club environment\, shining all around the world.\n\nTo find out more--Msg
  us on our webpage \\(under Contact Us\\) button at\n\nhttps://mareisland.
 toastmastersclubs.org/\n\nIf you will join us in-person on the first or se
 cond Thursday of the month\, we meet this week at Kaiser Hospital Bldg. A.
  3rd floor meeting room. When you enter the hospital building\, go past th
 e piano to the elevator. Go to the 3rd floor. Exit left out of the elevato
 r and left at the hall. Go past the gym and take a left at the hall. Walk 
 down the long hall to the meeting room.
URL:https://signup.com/go/WiniixA
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
