 ertos Community Altar and Celebration\, on view Monday\, October 26 throug
 h Friday\, October 30\, and open daily from 10 to 4 PM. Throughout the wee
 k\, visitors are invited to experience the community altar and participate
  in special performances\, art activities\, and gatherings.\n\n**Monday\, 
 October 26 | 10 AM–4 PM** **Pet Day** Honor and remember beloved animal 
 companions as part of our community altar.\n\n**Tuesday\, October 27 | 12
 –12:30 PM** **Mariachi Lobos Performance | Seawolf Plaza** Enjoy a speci
 al performance by *Mariachi Lobos* from Elsie Allen High School.\n\n**Wedn
 esday–Thursday\, October 28–29** **Drop-In Art Activities** Join us fo
 r daily hands-on activities\, including marigold making and a *papel picad
 o* station.\n\n**Friday\, October 30 | 12–1 PM** **Closing Celebration**
  Gather with us for a special closing celebration featuring guest speaker 
 Dra. Natalia Villanueva-Nieves\, a taco lunch\, and a hands-on printmaking
  activity.
