 tirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.Jose Solorio is a Full-Stack Web 
 Developer at Graton Resort &amp\; Casino.Learn more on the SRJC Computer S
 tudies' AI Talks website. (https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026)
