SUMMARY:Reconnect\, rehydrate\, and restore your body with the Melt Method
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T125000
UID:tribe-10006213@sonomacommunitycenter.org
DESCRIPTION:checklistMore DetailscommentDescriptionmanage_accountsInstruct
 or InfoinfoFAQprogram overviewCreated by exercise specialist Sue Hitzmann\
 , this science-based approach focuses on two key areas: balancing your ner
 vous system and keeping your connective tissue healthy. When these work to
 gether properly\, they support your whole body and help your mind and body
  communicate better. The method has helped thousands of people and offers 
 a unique way to prevent pain before it starts.instructor OverviewRegin
LOCATION:Room 213\, Dance Studio\, 276 East Napa Street\, Sonoma\, CA
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/melt-method/2026-10-30/
X-SOURCE:Sonoma Community Center
END:VEVENT
