DESCRIPTION:Friday\, October 30th\n\n3:00pm - 6:00pm\n\nGeneral Admission 
 $20\n\nAdd a 70 chip game card for only $10!\n\nThe best part? This event 
 falls on a Double Play Friday\, meaning all arcade games are half priced!\
 n\n• Please arrive 15 minutes early for check-in.\n\n• Only 50 spots a
 vailable per timeslot — Register today!\n\n• Recommended for ages 4-12
 \n\nFollow the clues\, complete the activities\, and collect your prize!\n
 \nRegistration is required. Select a time slot between 3pm and 6pm.\n\nEac
 h participant will receive an activity card and set off on a fun-filled qu
 est with 5 clues and activities hidden throughout the facility.\n\nSolve t
 hem all to unlock the final challenge and claim your reward—a 30-minute 
 Sky Zone jump voucher and a sweet ice cream treat from Freeze & Fuel!\n\nP
 lus\, enjoy trick-or-treating stations along the way for even more Hallowe
 en fun.\n\nCostumes encouraged but not required!\n\nNo weapons of any kind
  \\(including props\\) or full face coverings are allowed due to safety re
 asons.
LOCATION:Poppy Bank Epicenter
URL:https://visitepicenter.com/youth-halloween-scavenger-hunt
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
