DESCRIPTION:Dare to climb in the dark?!\n\nJoin us for a spooktacular\, fa
 mily-friendly night filled with lights-out headlamp climbing\, candy-packe
 d trick-or-treat try-a-climbs\, and a costume contest you have to see to b
 elieve! Bring your headlamp\, friends & family\, and send some climbs! If 
 you don't own a headlamp\, no worries - we sell them in our retail space.\
 n\nFriday\, October 30th | 6-9:30pm\n\nSchedule:\n\n5:00 - 6:00 pm: GYM CL
 OSED for Party Prep\n\n6:00 - 9:00 pm: Free Trick-or-Treat Try-a-Climbs Op
 en. Get belayed by our staff + every route has a sweet reward!\n\n7:00 - 9
 :30 pm: Lights Out Headlamp Climbing Commences!\n\n8:00 - 8:30 pm: Costume
  Contest for 3 Age Groups to Win in 3 Categories: Most Unique\, Spookiest\
 , and Silliest + NEW THIS YEAR: Best Group Costume (no age\, group of 5 ma
 x)\n\n9:30 pm: Glowstick Grab - collect as many glowsticks as you can befo
 re we close!\n\n10:00 pm: Gym Closing\n\nPricing:\n\nNon-Members - $14 Day
  Pass\n\nMembers - FREE\n\nBeginners and kids welcome - it’s a family-fr
 iendly night of fun!
