  through October 30\\) Group 15 or more Discount $23.40 \\(September 9 thr
 ough October 16\\) Group 15 or more Discount $25.40 \\(October 17 through 
 October 30\\)\n\nTicket Info: https://tickets.marincenter.org/eventperform
 ances.asp?evt=494\n\nDrop in on Warren Miller's 77th film\, Days Off. Joi 
 n host Katie Burrell as she pulls back the curtain on what the pros do on 
 their days off. Go skijoring in Banff\, join Craig McMorris and friends in
  Whistler\, and explore Alaska's spines with Sam Kuch and Cra ig Murray. W
 atch Jess Kimura push snowboarding forward and inspire the next generation
  in Hokkaido\, Japan. Head to Chamonix for an intense high-alpine pivot wi
 th Christina "Lusti" Lustenberger. Then\, hit Deer Valley with Ted Ligety\
 , Kaylin Richardson\, Pep Fujas\, Chuck Mumford\, and their broods\, plus 
