BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://eventvesta.com/events/160339/t/tickets", "Visit Santa Rosa": "https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/halloween-masquerade-ball-creatures-of-the-night/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://eventvesta.com/events/160339/t/tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Halloween Masquerade Ball: Creatures of the Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T220000
UID:260831QFT3KTy4UUiWgErK00pNEA
DESCRIPTION:As daylight fades\, another world begins to stir.\n\nWe invite
  guests into an evening shaped by shadow and candlelight\, where masks con
 ceal identities\, music fills the darkness\, and the familiar gives way to
  something far more mysterious. Inspired by nocturnal legends\, ancient fo
 lklore\, dark fairy tales\, and the timeless decadence of the masquerade\,
  Creatures of the Night is a celebration of mystery\, transformation\, ele
 gance\, and indulgence.\n\nFor one night\, become something otherworldly.\
 n\nDraw inspiration from the creatures that have haunted stories for centu
 ries: vampires\, witches\, warlocks\, ghouls\, demons\, banshees\, sirens\
 , mermaids\, spiders\, and spectral beings that linger between this world 
 and the next. Perhaps you are a seductive vampire draped in velvet. A sea 
 siren adorned in shimmering scales...\n\nCostumes are encouraged to captur
 e the spirit of the night while embracing the elegance\, drama\, and intri
 gue of a masquerade. Come masked. Come transformed. Come as something thin
 g that only emerges after dark.\n\nIMPORTANT PARKING DETAILS - PLEASE READ
 \n\nDue to Buena Vista's limited parking\, we are offering a limited numbe
 r of ON-SITE VIP Parking Tickets available at $15 per parking space. Avail
 able at checkout as an "ADD-ON" option. For guests not purchasing a VIP Pa
 rking ticket\, you must park Downtown at the Sonoma Plaza or Ridesharing \
 \(Uber or Lyft\\) is encouraged. We will provide Shuttle service at no cha
 rge in front of the Sonoma Mission 114 East Spain Street\, Sonoma\, beginn
 ing at 6:15pm - running every 15 minutes. Downtown parking is available at
  public parking lots\, at no charge. The largest is the Casa Grande lot\, 
 located behind the historic Barracks just north of the Plaza\, with an ent
 rance off First Street East. There are also numerous spaces surrounding th
 e Sonoma Plaza. Private transportation/Ridesharing services are more than 
 welcome to drop off and pick up guests directly at Buena Vista.
LOCATION:Buena Vista Historical Winery
URL:https://eventvesta.com/events/160339/t/tickets
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
