UID:260909veBUzAKV3kiYv4WJHVDrQg
DESCRIPTION:***MELANCHOLIA*  Royal Swedish Opera 2023** Music by Mi
 kael Karlsson\, libretto by Royce Vavrek. At her wedding reception\, 
 the beautiful but depressed Justine spots a red star in the sky. It is the
  planet Melancholia\, which is on a collision course with Earth. The bride
 groom Michael tries to calm her down with his love\, her mother Gaby poiso
 ns her with her darkness\, and her sister Claire attempts to rescue her wi
 th her solicitude. But no-one can stop the mysterious forces ignited withi
 n Justine. And Melancholia gets closer and closer…Based on the 2011 film
 \, ***Melancholia***\, a science fiction drama film written and directe
 d by Lars von Trier.
LOCATION:Jarvis Conservatory
URL:https://jarvisconservatory.ticketspice.com/melancholia
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
