SUMMARY:Trick-or-Treat Flight + Live Music by Adam Lieb
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T170000
UID:261013JRAvJSIqOk6l6W8zTJw84Q
DESCRIPTION:Kick off Halloween night with us! Our Saturday Live Music & Ta
 sting Experience is getting dressed up for the occasion. Come in costume (
 or don't\, we won't judge)\, sip our Reserve Tasting Flight paired with a 
 little something sweet\, and grab a glass of witches' brew from the giant 
 cauldron bubbling in the tasting room. Everyone's welcome\, ghouls and gob
 lins included.\n\nThe Treat\n\nOur $40 Reserve Tasting Flight of six award
 -winning wines\, each paired with a hand-picked Halloween candy. Wine club
  members receive up to 4 complimentary flights per visit\, depending on me
 mbership level.\n\nWitches' Brew\n\nOur autumn sangria\, served straight f
 rom the cauldron. $10 a glass (21+).\n\nFeatured Performance\n\nAdam Lieb 
 takes the stage for a special Halloween set. Adam Lieb delivers music infu
 sed with passion\, craftsmanship\, and deep cultural roots. A Brooklyn nat
 ive now based in Northern California\, Adam’s dynamic performances — w
 hether solo or with his Disorderly House Band — showcase a lifetime of m
 usical exploration\, from touring with Robert Fripp’s League of Crafty G
 uitarists to recording at Abbey Road Studios.\n\nDetails\n\nWalk-ins are w
 elcome\, but priority seating goes to wine club members and guests with re
 servations. Halloween fills up fast\, so book your table. No outside food\
 , but we're dog and family friendly (costumed pups strongly encouraged). F
 or groups of 13 or more\, email visit@spicyvines.com.\n\nOr visit https://
 spicyvines.com/event/ for more info!
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/events/trick-or-treat-flight-live-music-by-adam
 -lieb/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
