DESCRIPTION:Halloween Costume Contest – October 31\, 2026 Get dressed up
  and join us for a Halloween Costume Contest at Konocti Vista Casino on Sa
 turday\, October 31! Show off your best Halloween look for your chance to 
 win your share of $1\,000 CASH! Costume Contest Details Saturday\, October
  31\, 2026 Sign Up: 6:00 PM – 9:30 PM - Winner Announced shortly after 1
 0pm! Prize Pool: $1\,000 Cash - 1st Place wins $500 Cash\, 2nd Place wins 
 $300 Cash and 3rd Place wins $200 Cash. Eligibility: Earn 5 same-day point
 s to participate. After the contest\, keep the Halloween celebration going
  at the Point Bar After Party\, featuring a DJ starting at 10:00 PM! Must 
 be a Konocti Vista Casino Player's Club member and 21 or older. Must earn 
 5 same-day points to be eligible for the contest. Must have minimum of 5 p
 articipants in contest to award prizes. Note: No masks or face paint are a
 llowed in the casino except during judging. No weapons allowed in casino. 
