DESCRIPTION:Halloween Party and Unveiling of Colossal Fossil at Hall of th
 e Above\n\n🦴 Dredged from riverbed: fossilized remains of Prehistoric A
 vian Megafauna.\n\n🐓 Behold the mighty ancestor of our beloved Poultry\
 , Pride of Petaluma.\n\n🎶 Welcome the spirit of El Pollo Muerto with a 
 night of music and revelry.\n\n🕺 Do the Funky Chicken with 6 DJs going 
 Free Range on 2 dance floors.\n\n🍬 Sample an egg-cellent selection of c
 reepy candy in the Haunted Henhouse.\n\n🔮 Crack the cosmic egg and disc
 over your future with our resident Tarot Card Reader.\n\n📸 Photo booth 
 provided for group and individual selfies in The Incubator.\n\n🥂 It’s
  too early for Egg Nog\, but gather a Clutch of Cocktails at 3 cash bars.\
 n\n🍕 The Geist of Honor has requested no chicken be served at our curbs
 ide pizza truck.\n\n🧟 Attendees are urged to dress appropriately\, i.e.
