DESCRIPTION:Midweek plans just got better. Fieldwork’s new Wing Wednesda
 y special pairs crispy\, flavor-packed wings with a beer of your choice fo
 r $20\, making it the perfect excuse to settle in for a laid-back evening 
 at the Village.\n\nChoose from Honey Calabrian\, Hot Buffalo\, or Garlic P
 armesan Oregano\, each thoughtfully paired with styles from Fieldwork’s 
 rotating taplist\, from juicy Hazy IPAs to crisp European lagers and class
 ic West Coast pours. Whether you’re meeting friends or easing into the e
 vening\, it’s a weekly ritual worth making time for.
