BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.facebook.com/events/983276331451381/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Meet + Greet: Hilo: The Hiloday Special by Judd Winick
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T153000
UID:261014Qe9ahRVd7k-3jSOz5BfJcQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special meet-and-greet event with Judd Winick\, 
 author of Hilo: The Hiloday Special. This event is free\, but we appreciat
 e your RSVP below so we can plan for your attendance. ABOUT THE BOOK From 
 the New York Times bestselling graphic novel series Hilo comes the first-e
 ver Holiday Special! Hilo and friends are ready for holiday fun\, until a 
 giant\, super-grumpy snowman crashes the celebration. Can they figure out 
 what he wants before the big holiday party? “A story that can be enjoyed
  by the entire family.”—The New York Times “An action-packed page-tu
 rner with heart!” – Dav Pilkey\, creator of DOG MAN The decorations ar
 e up! The gifts are wrapped! And Hilo and the gang are enjoying some holid
 ay togetherness. Sure\, it would be better if the skating pond wasn’t bl
 ocked off. And if someone wasn’t stealing trees from the tree lot. AND i
 f a giant\, super grumpy snowman wasn’t going around destroying things. 
 But what’s a holiday without holiday surprises?! Can Hilo and friends fi
 gure out what the snowman wants before D.J.’s big family party?! Packed 
 with family and food\, love and laughter \\(lots of laughter!\\)—gather 
 around and enjoy all the gifts of the season with Hilo! ABOUT THE AUTHOR J
 udd Winick is the creator of the beloved New York Times bestselling HILO s
 eries\, and the spinoff graphic novel THE MIGHTY. He lives in San Francisc
 o with his wife and their two kids. Judd has written bestselling comic boo
 k series\, has appeared as a cast member on MTV's The Real World: San Fran
 cisco\, and is the author of the acclaimed graphic novel Pedro and Me\, ab
 out his Real World friend AIDS activist Pedro Zamora.
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/983276331451381/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
