UID:2610232Cdq5pgka0yY3BlQCfpJHA
DESCRIPTION:Test your knowledge and have fun learning about native plants!
  Join the Laguna de Santa Rosa Foundation\, California Native Plant Societ
 y – Milo Baker Chapter\, and Sonoma County Ag \\+ Open Space for this in
 teractive trivia event that has something for everyone. Join rounds of fri
 endly competition\, test your knowledge\, and discover fascinating facts a
 bout the native plants that support local wildlife and resilient landscape
 s. You can come solo or bring a team and enjoy the chance to connect with 
 fellow plant enthusiasts! Refreshments and snacks provided. There is no ch
 arge for this event. It is made possible by the taxpayers of Sonoma County
 \, who fund the work of Ag \\+ Open Space through a quarter-cent sales tax
