DESCRIPTION:Experience a night of live blues featuring The Old Souls Blues
  Experiment and George Palma’s Biter Blues Band\, performing one after t
 he other. Founded by Remi Moulder\, The Old Souls Blues Experiment deliver
 s high-voltage electric blues-rock inspired by legends like B.B. King\, Er
 ic Clapton\, Stevie Ray Vaughan\, and Joe Bonamassa. This dynamic collecti
 ve of young musicians blends the raw energy of modern blues-rock with the 
 timeless grit of the masters. Then\, George Palma’s Biter Blues Band bri
 ngs the dance floor to life with harmonica-driven blues\, jump blues\, and
  classic West Coast swing. With soulful sounds\, infectious rhythms\, and 
 plenty of danceable grooves\, both bands celebrate the enduring spirit of 
 the blues. Doors Open:  6:30 PM | Show Starts: 7:30 PM $17 advance. At the
  door $22 \\*The price includes a $2 ticketing fee per ticket to cover cos
 ts of 3rd party ticket service and credit card fees
LOCATION:The California
