DESCRIPTION:checklistMore DetailscommentDescriptionmanage_accountsInstruct
 or InfoinfoFAQprogram overviewChoose a favorite photo of a pet and learn h
 ow to render it as a watercolor portrait. Over three weeks\, you’ll rece
 ive instruction from an artist who has painted many commissioned pet portr
 aits in watercolor. Instructor Hannah Day will share her insights and her 
 approach to rendering animals in this medium\, guiding you through a layer
 ing process that builds vibrancy\, detail\, and depth.Whether you’re new
  t
