 5 – Sonoma Ridge in Sonoma Developmental Center/Jack London. 9.67 miles\
 , 2\,126 ft. elevation (meet at the intersection of Arnold Dr. and Harney 
 Rd.\, inside the SDC).\n\nSat.  Nov. 21 – "The Big Loop" at Sugarloaf. 
 7.37 miles\, 1\,739 ft elevation (meet at Sugarloaf Ridge State Park).
