DESCRIPTION:Lace up and hit the trails at Brassfield Estate Winery\, set h
 igh above Lake County in the High Valley AVA. Choose your challenge — 5K
 \, 10K\, or 10-mile — and run through vineyards\, volcanic soils\, and r
 olling hills with views of Mount Konocti and Round Mountain along the way.
  All entrees include a glass of wine and a custom race hat. 8:00 - 9:30 AM
 : Bib pick-up & check-in  10:00 AM: 10 mile race start 10:15 AM: 10K race 
 start  10:30 AM: 5K race start  Cross the finish line into a celebration 
 — enjoy wine\, food\, and live music as you relax and toast to a race we
 ll run. Whether you're chasing a personal best or just here for good compa
 ny \\(and better wine\\)\, this is a High Valley experience you won't want
  to miss.
