SUMMARY:Vallejo Piecemakers Quilt Guild Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T150000
UID:261016sKca8YxieUix5PKaXsirLg
DESCRIPTION:Together\, the Vallejo Piecemakers Quilt Guild \\(VPQG\\) brin
 gs the art of quilting to our members and the communities we touch. We mee
 t on the first Saturdays of the month for a business meeting\, workshops a
 nd open sew. Whether you’re working on an old project or beginning a new
  one\, VPQG is a place to come together and create. We hope you will join 
 us.\n\nVPQG is a 501\\(c\\)7 social club supported by its membership. Ever
 yone is welcome to attend one meeting per year as our guest\, but we would
  request that you join the guild before attending additional meetings.
