 ct weekend meandering through rolling hills and sun-kissed vineyards\, dis
 covering flavor combinations that'll become your new obsessions. Here's wh
 at makes this special: you're not just tasting\, you're experiencing. Each
  winery has handpicked a signature dish that tells their story\, perfectly
  matched with a wine that brings out flavors you didn't even know existed.
  It's like having personal sommeliers sharing their secrets with you! And 
