 fully sold their creations at the Harvest Festival® Original Art & Craft 
 Shows. We have seven established venues that attract thousands of eager sh
 oppers with their "shop till you drop" attitude\, looking for their next t
 reasures to purchase. Don't miss your opportunity to join us on our 2026 t
 our. No application or jury fee. Category limitations. No commission on sa
 les. Indoor booths in climate-controlled facilities\, hotel discounts\, ex
 hibitor shipping\, 24 hr. security. No buy & sell\, commercial\, or import
 ed products allowed in our artisan booths. Extensive marketing in all medi
 as.
