SUMMARY:The Lost Boats of Mare Island Memorial
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T150000
UID:261023jVc1PC6UiU-m1SZAqj_stA
DESCRIPTION:Join Myrna Hayes\, President\, Mare Island Heritage Trust and 
 Larry Maggini\, Co-founders and Hosts of our 20th anniversary Lost Boats o
 f Mare Island Memorial Dockside on the shores of the Napa River Mare Islan
 d Strait for our service of history\, music and remembrance to honor the 7
  submarines built at Mare Island and lost at sea during WWII. 569 men are 
 still serving “On Eternal Patrol” aboard these vessels located somewhe
 re in the depths of the Pacific Ocean\, their final resting place known on
 ly to God. Help us to honor them by gathering with us for this free\, annu
 al memorial service.\n\nThe Lost Boats Memorial service planned at Mare Is
 land is free of charge. It is a rain or shine event. If planning to attend
 \, dress for all possible weather including warm midday sun\, cool skies a
 nd even rain or fog and bring an umbrella.
LOCATION:Berth 6
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2919433355100398
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
