DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T210000
UID:2610028ILUAuLwbEK-uvOpIEu1Kg
DESCRIPTION:Every life has its crossroads: moments when we choose one path
  over another\, take a leap into the unknown\, or look back and wonder wha
 t might have happened if we had chosen differently.\n\nOn **Sunday\, Novem
 ber 8 at 7:00 p.m.**\, **Bay Area Playback Theatre** invites audiences to 
 explore those moments in **“Stories of Crossroads\,”** an evening of s
 pontaneous\, audience-interactive theatre at **Marin Theatre in Mill Valle
 y**.
LOCATION:Marin Theatre Company - Lieberman Studio Theatre
URL:http://www.bayareaplayback.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
