DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Raise Your Spiri
 tual IQ!**\n\n**Are your dreams a mystery? Not understandable?**\n\n**Woul
 d you like spiritual tools to change that?**\n\n**Are you ready to awaken 
 to your full**\n**spiritual potential through your dreams?**\n\nCome to th
 is FREE online workshop on dreams!\n\n"As Soul\, you have the God knowledg
 e within you."\n—Harold Klemp\, *Raise Your Spiritual IQ!\,* inside cove
 r\n\nThis workshop explores different ways to understand your own dream la
 nguage\, and with these spiritual tools\, can help you live your life in a
  greater\, more fulfilling way.\n\n***What to expect. . . .***\n• Expand
  your inner awareness with dream tools\n• Share your experiences with ot
 her like-hearted people!\n• Learn ways to handle challenges from a spiri
 tual perspective\n• Discover techniques to access your divine intuition\
 n• Get simple spiritual exercises to directly connect with the Life Sour
 ce\n\nDownload the free pdf *Raise Your Spiritual IQ! Experience Journal* 
 to jumpstart your spiritual adventure! **[HERE](https://www.eckankar.org/w
 p-content/uploads/2024/10/IQ_Experience-Journal.pdf)**\n\nAll faiths welco
 me!\nRegister here on Meetup! We’d love to see you!
