UID:TKF/640bd014795edf4fa3769b14/580/29905620/0/0
DTSTART:20261110T190000Z
DTEND:20261110T223000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/580/1794337200000
SUMMARY: Abstract Watercolor painting
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Abstract Watercolor Painting at Riley Street\, Sa
 nta Rosa\n\nInstructor: Anne Millett\n\nDate: Tuesday\, November 10th\n\n
 Time: 11:00AM-2:30PM\n\nFee: $45.00\n\n\nThere will be over 70 high quali
 ty paint colors for you to choose from\, plus 6 metallics. You will spend
  time selecting your colors intuitively\, for the way they make you feel 
 in the moment. This process is quite personal.\n\nWhat we paint does not 
 need to accurately represent real things that we see in the "outside worl
 d". We listen to our intuitions as our paintings build shape by shape\, m
 ark by mark\, without planning the end result. We paint simply and method
 ically\, focusing on putting paint on paper and seeing what happens\, the
 n where we'll go next.\n\nHigh quality watercolor paint\, very good brush
 es\, 1 piece of Arches 140# cold press watercolor paper (and a second if 
 you finish your first painting)\, and complete set-ups for painting in cl
 ass will be provided.\n\n\nThis class is designed for adults 18+\n\nAll l
 evels of experience welcome\n\nclass sizes are limited to 8 people\, plea
 se register early\n\nEmail the instructor\, Anne Millett\, for registrati
 on and payment details: mailto:classes@miraaster.com classes@miraaster.co
 m mailto:classes@miraaster.com
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Watercolor
