UID:260109AIB8apG00UOklXlfDv5Yaw
DESCRIPTION:Each month we gather to transform humble materials into beauti
 fully crafted brooms that’ll make your everyday cleanup feel like an upg
 rade. Whether you’re drawn to classic corn brooms\, sleek hearth sweeper
 s\, or want to design something that’s never been seen before- there’s
  a spot at the workbench with your name on it.\n\nNo prior experience need
 ed! Our crew of makers ranges from first-time crafters to seasoned hands\,
  all sharing the same mission: creating functional art that’s too pretty
  to hide in the closet and that’ll make sweeping feel like showing off.
