DESCRIPTION:As generative AI becomes embedded across disciplines\, higher 
 education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle between opposing camps\, 
 but of intentional design.  Generative systems offer novel capabilities fo
 r research\, creation\, and learning\, yet their ultimate value depends en
 tirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.Reg Rodriguez serves as subject m
 atter expert evaluating the quality and accuracy of AI-generated legal con
 tent.Learn more on the SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks website. (https://c
 s.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026)
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T190552Z
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23946-reg-rodriguez-human-agency-
 machine-inquiry
