 urg CA\, 95448\n\nThe BluesBurners throw down a spicy mix of funk\, rock\,
  electric blues\, and old school R & B.  Voted favorite local band by KRS
 H listeners and nominated for a NORBAY for Best R&B/Blues Band\, The Blues
 Burners are an experienced and talented blend of musicians whose motto  "
 It's All About the Groove" makes our mission  clear. We aim to move you\,
  groove you\, put a smile on your lips and make you shake your hips!
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma
URL:https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/the-bluesburners-1113-p263.aspx
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
