DESCRIPTION:Welcome Spandex Rebellion that is Careless Whisper\, The 1980s
  Live.\n\nCareless Whisper brings the MTV and Sunset Strip ’80s party to
  life with high-energy hits\, wild costumes\, rad choreography\, and nonst
 op audience participation. \n\nWith a glam rock aesthetic and a setlist pa
 cked with the decade’s biggest anthems\, every show is a neon-soaked tri
 p back to the most fun era in music.\n\nWhether it's the iconic tunes of G
 eorge Michael and Bon Jovi\, the dance-pop anthems of Whitney Houston\, or
  the rock ballads of Journey\, Careless Whisper transports back to feeling
  alive in 1985 with an endless 80s playlist.\n\nRelive the 80s\, LIVE with
  Careless Whisper.
