X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/sacred-sounds-sessions-arctic-beats-with-snow-raven-sr1e26/?lang=en", "Press Democrat": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/sacred-sounds-sessions-arctic-beats-with-snow-raven-sr1e26/?lang=en"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/sacred-sounds-sessions-arctic-beats-with-snow-raven-sr1e26/?lang=en"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Sacred Sounds Sessions: Arctic Beats with Snow Raven
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T210000
UID:2607152w1x3A19ZkKJLsN09SZKUQ
DESCRIPTION:with Snow Raven\n\nFollow the rhythms back to yourself.\n\nRoo
 ted in the ancient wisdom of the Sakha people and the living pulse of the 
 Arctic world\, Snow Raven weaves sacred vocal traditions with deep bass\, 
 hypnotic rhythms\, and immersive live looping into a one-of-a-kind sonic c
 eremony.\n\nJourney inward through:\n\nThe *khomus* (Sakha mouth harp)
 —trance-inducing vibration that stills the mind\n\nBird & animal calls t
 hat reawaken your wild\, instinctual self\n\nEthereal shamanic singing tha
 t bridges seen and unseen worlds\n\nArctic-inspired beats that move body a
 nd soul\n\nThis is more than a concert—it’s a ceremony in sound. Come 
 ready to dance\, drop in\, and remember who you are through the rhythms of
  the natural world.\n\nCommunity song. Sacred dance. Ancient sound. Modern
  floor.\n\nBring a picnic: Gates will open two hours before the performanc
 e.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/sacred-sounds-sessions
 -arctic-beats-with-snow-raven-sr1e26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
