SUMMARY:Write & Collage: Words\, Images & Memory
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T120000
UID:2610248VTNCQL7GkKZo6GgFueuag
DESCRIPTION:Join Marlene Cullen for a creative two-hour experience that br
 ings writing and collage together. In the first hour\, guided freewriting 
 prompts invite you to explore memorable moments\, stories\, and experience
 s in a welcoming\, supportive environment. In the second hour\, transform 
 those reflections into a visual expression using images\, colors\, and tex
 tures.\n\nNo writing or art experience is necessary&mdash\;just bring your
  curiosity and a willingness to explore.\n\nBring: A notebook and pen. Col
 lage materials will be provided\, and you're welcome to bring a favorite p
 oem\, magazines\, photographs\, or other materials you'd like to incorpora
 te.\n\nMarlene Cullen is the founder of Writers Forum and creator of Jumps
 tart Writing Workshops. Through her website and blog\, The Write Spot\, sh
 e shares resources and inspiration to help writers discover and develop th
 eir voices.\n\nThe Write Spot anthologies edited by Marlene are collection
 s of short stories\, poems\, and vignettes with prompts to encourage writi
 ng.
LOCATION:Petaluma Arts Center
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/write-collage-words-images
 -memory?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
