BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.nershalom.org/event-calendar/2026/11/14-zoe-lewis", "Press Democrat": "https://www.nershalom.org/event-calendar/2026/11/14-zoe-lewis"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.nershalom.org/event-calendar/2026/11/14-zoe-lewis"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:An Evening with Zoë Lewis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T210000
UID:2610163jEGLb-zj0K6jS13OkwSPQ
DESCRIPTION:Affectionately know as “a band in a body\,” Zoë Lewis pla
 ys vintage jazz and world beat grooves on anything from the piano to ukul
 ele to the spoons! \n\nOriginally from the UK\, this astonishing singer-s
 ongwriter has called Provincetown her home for the last 32 years. She's tr
 aveled to over 70 countries picking up musical grooves and stories along t
 he way\, released ten albums of original material\, toured with the Indigo
  Girls\, Judy Collins\, Richie Havens\, Nanci Griffiths and has even opene
 d for Pat Benatar on the ukulele! \n\nHer songs have won numerous accolad
 es\, have appeared in films\, on Broadway\, in commercials\, and most rece
 ntly on the Netflix kid show *StoryBots*. She’s written 3 musicals that 
 received rave reviews\, performs for OLIVIA cruises\, and takes her show t
 o Puerto Vallarta\, Mexico every winter.\n\nZoe will be joined by the fabu
 lous KATE WOLF on bass.\n\nAn evening with Zoe Lewis will leave you with l
 ong-lasting joy. Join us!
LOCATION:Congregation Ner Shalom
URL:https://www.nershalom.org/event-calendar/2026/11/14-zoe-lewis
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.eventbrite.com/e/western-swing-dance-concert-with-the-dogweeds-tickets-1999737350246?aff=oddtdtcreator#location", "Press Democrat": "https://www.eventbrite.com/e/western-swing-dance-concert-with-the-dogweeds-tickets-1999737350246?aff=oddtdtcreator#location"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.eventbrite.com/e/western-swing-dance-concert-with-the-dogweeds-tickets-1999737350246?aff=oddtdtcreator#location"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Western Swing Night with The Dogweeds
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T220000
UID:260929b2UJEJD0ykmohgEvpwUUbQ
DESCRIPTION:Get on your cowboy boots\, grab your honey and come out to the
  Napa Grange for a great evening of Western Swing with The Dogweeds!\n\nDB
  Productions and the Welcome Grange bring another great evening of live mu
 sic to Napa. The Dogweeds draw inspiration from the Western Swing dance ba
 nds of the 1930's and 40's\, but with a modern take. Blazing instrumentals
  and honest\, soulful vocal harmonies meet dance-inspiring grooves in a so
 und that is both unique and familiar. Genre bending originals add elements
  of jazz\, blues\, vintage pop and folk\, while dazzling new arrangements 
 bring old classics and deep cuts to life.\n\n"*Lyrics to make you think\, 
 but music to make you move... "* Rachel Cholst\, Adobe and Teardrops\n\n"*
 red-hot musicianship and a genuine love for Western Swing - proof that the
  genre thrives in the hands of the next generation."* Mae McCoy\, Western 
 Swing Society
LOCATION:Napa Welcome Grange
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/western-swing-dance-concert-with-the-dogw
 eeds-tickets-1999737350246?aff=oddtdtcreator#location
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
