DESCRIPTION:Get ready to laugh until your sides hurt because **Adam Caro
 lla** is coming to town! \n\nThis stand-up comedy show\, headlined by th
 e legendary comedian\, radio personality\, and podcasting king\, Adam Ca
 rolla\, promises an evening of unfiltered humor and razor-sharp wit.\n\n 
 Carolla\, known for his work on "Loveline\," "The Man Show\," and "The Ad
 am Carolla Show" podcast\, has a unique comedic style that combines obser
 vational humor with biting social commentary.\n\n Don't miss your chance 
 to see this comedy powerhouse live and experience why his podcasts hold th
 e Guinness World Record for the most downloaded ever. \n\nGrab your ticke
 ts now for a night of unforgettable laughter!\n\nSeating is first-come\, f
 irst-served based on the within the area you purchase.\n\nGolden Circle en
 compases the first several rows of the floor.
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://wl.eventim.us/event/adam-carolla-or-fully-seated/687971?afflky
 =MysticTheatre
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
