DESCRIPTION:WinterBlast\, the Santa Rosa Urban Arts Partnership's annual W
 inter Parade and Sofa Festival. This will be the  22nd annual nighttime pr
 ocession of wildly decorated sofas being pushed through the streets among 
 stilt walkers\, marching bands and a sea of lanterns. There will be food\,
  music\, a host of engaging activities\, and a number of open art studios 
 to visit.  It all happens in the SofA Arts District in Santa Rosa.  In the
  months leading up to WinterBlast there will be a series of lantern\, pupp
 etry\, and sofa building workshops. Please see posts here for sign-ups as 
 they become available.
