UID:2610239QoO-sWy2E-j_6zLYzAHag
DESCRIPTION:Join Marin Baroque and renowned Bay Area musicians Eliyahu Sil
 ls and Rachel Valfer Sills of the Qadim Ensemble\, for a transcendent musi
 cal journey through ancient Sephardic\, Islamic and Christian music of Alg
 eria\, Morocco\, Spain\, Turkey\, and Italy as well as music of 17th centu
 ry prince\, composer\, philosopher and researcher\, Dimitrie Cantemir. \n
 \nThe works featured in this concert exemplify musical unity\, highlightin
 g music originating from regions commonly involved in conflict with a mess
 age of peace.
LOCATION:Congregation Rodef Sholom
URL:https://www.rodefsholom.org/event/songs-of-the-mediterranean-with-mari
 n-baroque.html
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
