BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.tickettailor.com/events/lagunalab/2417443", "Press Democrat": "https://www.tickettailor.com/events/lagunalab/2417443"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.tickettailor.com/events/lagunalab/2417443"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Freestyle Playground Dance Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T193000
UID:261008q8awTNndRkORZl9mc_N2TA
DESCRIPTION:Freestyle Playground — 4-Week Dance & Movement Series\n\nExp
 lore. Play. Create. Express.\n\nReady to discover new ways of moving and e
 xpressing yourself through dance?\n\nFreestyle Playground is a playful\, c
 reative dance class designed to expand your movement vocabulary\, spark yo
 ur imagination\, and help you discover your own unique movement style.\n\n
 Through guided freestyle exercises\, imaginative movement concepts\, music
 ality\, elements of popping\, rhythm\, and body awareness\, you'll explore
  new ways to move\, experiment\, and create.\n\nEach week\, we'll introduc
 e different movement tools and concepts that you can combine\, build upon\
 , and incorporate into your own dancing.\n\nThis isn't a choreography-base
 d class. It's about exploration\, curiosity\, and the freedom to move with
 out worrying about getting it "right."\n\nWhether you're an experienced da
 ncer looking for fresh inspiration or someone curious about exploring move
 ment\, all levels are welcome!\n\nClass Details\n\n📍 Laguna Lab | Sebas
 topol\, CA\n\n📅 4 Tuesdays: October 27\, November 3\, 10 & 17\n\n⏰ 6:
 30–7:30 PM\n\n💃 All levels welcome!\n\nCome expand your creativity\, 
 discover new movement possibilities\, and experience the joy of freestyle 
 dance!\n\nNo perfection. Just movement\, music\, imagination & PLAY!
LOCATION:Laguna Lab
URL:https://www.tickettailor.com/events/lagunalab/2417443
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/intermediate-salsa-class/17159571/2026-11-17T18", "Press Democrat": "https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-class-intermediate-tuesday/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/intermediate-salsa-class/17159571/2026-11-17T18"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Intermediate Salsa Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T193000
UID:260704XPn-J8TWO0SnQTHqJLRimg
DESCRIPTION:This class is designed for dancers who have a solid grasp of t
 he basics and are eager to expand their repertoire with more complex and f
 luid movements.\n\nPre- requisite:\n\nSalsa Class Beginners\n\nEach week\,
  we’ll break down a new move\, focusing on the technique and connection 
 that will make you a more confident and stylish dancer. We’ll go beyond 
 the foundational steps to cover a wide range of essential intermediate pat
 terns and styling\, including:\n\nTurns and Spins:\n\nMaster your inside a
 nd outside turns\, double spins\, and the elegant 360 and Hand Toss moves.
 \n\nIntricate Patterns:\n\nLearn to execute the 360\, wrap\, as well as va
 rious Cross Body Lead variations like the U-Turn and Spiral.\n\nFootwork a
 nd Styling:\n\nEnhance your rhythm and flair with advanced footwork like t
 he Suzy Q\, Front Tap\, and Mambo Step. We’ll also work on styling with 
 a wrap and improving your posture and upper body movement.\n\nThis class i
 s your chance to refine your technique\, improve your lead-follow connecti
 on\, and add a variety of fun and dynamic moves to your salsa vocabulary. 
 Join us and elevate your dance!\n\nDetails:\n\nNo partner necessary — ro
 tations ensure everyone gets to dance.\n\nPlease wear non-marking shoe so
 les to protect the floor.\n\nArrive 10 minutes early to warm up and get s
 ettled.\n\nDate & Time: Tuesdays @ 6:30PM – 7:30PM
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/intermediate-salsa-clas
 s/17159571/2026-11-17T18
