BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.euphoriaretreats.com/euphoria-day-retreats"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Gratitude November Sound Healing with Bob & Amelia
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T191500
UID:261003Mc2UZhHuuEWpA4RPJfNnrg
DESCRIPTION:ratitude November Sound Healing\n\nwith Bob & Amelia\n\nWednes
 day\, November 18th\, 2026 • 5:30pm to 7:15pm Flatbed Farm with AB Creat
 ions 10% proceeds Cancer Support Sonoma Pouring partner Lexi Loose Leaf Te
 a\n\nStep into a season of thanks at FlatBed Farm for a heartfelt evening 
 of sound healing\, reflection\, and gratitude. As the year winds down\, we
  invite you to pause\, breathe\, and honor the people\, moments\, and bles
 sings that fill your life. Let's give thanks together!\n\nAs golden light 
 settles over the fields\, gather in community at FlatBed Farm\, an intimat
 e sanctuary nestled in the heart of wine country overlooking Sonoma Region
 al Park. Lying down cozy in your space in the barn\, allow the soothing vi
 brations of crystal singing bowls\, gentle percussion\, and melodic chimes
  to wash over you\, opening your heart and harmonizing mind\, body\, and s
 pirit. This makes a great evening with friends or a date night!\n\nBob & A
 melia's sound healing experience is like no other. The evening begins at 5
 :30 pm with time to settle into the beauty of the farm\, followed by the s
 ound healing journey from 5:45–6:45 pm. Afterwards\, linger and connect 
 over a farm-fresh Lexi loose leaf tea during a gratitude journaling and ce
 remonial community closing toast.\n\nThis evening gives back\, too. Ten pe
 rcent of proceeds benefit Cancer Support Sonoma\, a local nonprofit offeri
 ng affordable integrative therapies that ease the physical\, mental\, and 
 emotional effects of cancer treatment for our Sonoma Valley neighbors. Don
 't miss this evening of gratitude and giving at FlatBed Farm\, a sanctuary
  for renewal\, connection\, and heartfelt thanks. Reserve your spot now. A
 ll three sold out last year\, and we love our community!
LOCATION:Flatbed Farm
URL:https://www.euphoriaretreats.com/euphoria-day-retreats
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
