BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/belly-dancing-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Belly Dancing with Raja - Thursdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T183000
UID:260817PmgIJZtPkEuAJJcwJaVnng
DESCRIPTION:DATE AND TIME: Thursdays\, 5:30 PM\n\nUnlock your inner streng
 th and find your flow. Belly dancing with Raja is an innovative fusion cl
 ass that blends the rhythmic artistry of belly dance with the high-energ
 y benefits of aerobics. Designed to be both a cardiovascular challenge an
 d a deep toning session\, this class focuses on the “powerhouse” of th
 e body—your core.\n\nBy layering fluid\, isolative movements over an ath
 letic aerobic base\, you will challenge your muscles in ways traditional g
 ym workouts can’t reach.\n\nWhat to Expect in Belly Dancing Class\n\n•
  Core-Centric Power: Use undulations and shimmies to engage deep abdomina
 l muscles for a tighter\, stronger midsection.\n\n• Functional Stability
 : Improve your balance and posture through controlled\, hip-driven moveme
 nts and low-impact aerobic footwork.\n\n• Total Body Toning: Build lean
  muscle in your legs\, glutes\, and arms while maintaining a constant\, he
 art-pumping pace.\n\n• Mind-Body Connection: Enhance your coordination 
 and body awareness through rhythmic\, expressive choreography.\n\n“Wheth
 er you’re looking to define your waistline or simply want a workout that
  feels like a celebration\, this class offers the perfect balance of sweat
  and grace.”\n\nDifficulty Level: All levels welcome! No prior dance ex
 perience is required—just bring your energy and a willingness to move.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/belly-dancing-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Sonoma County Womens Wine Club": "https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events/314849643/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_sonoma_county_womens_wine_club
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Women's Wine Club
UID:event_314849643@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261024T043510Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T190000
SUMMARY:THIRSTY THURSDAY New Member Social for Sonoma County Women's Wine 
 Club
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nThis is our regular c
 lub meeting\, held on the last Thursday of every month except for holidays
  and we are super excited! Come join us at 4th Street Cellars in downtown 
 Santa Rosa. They have generously offered to host our monthly THIRSTY THURS
 DAY social for us.\n\nIf you are new to the area\, or just looking to get 
 out of the house and make new friends\, this is the place for you. Welcomi
 ng to ALL new and (ahem\, old) members.\n\nWine is purchased by the glass 
 for a set fee of $13/$14 per glass with the variety of white\, rosé\, and
  red wines offered through 4th Street Cellars which includes tip. Fees are
  collected at the venue by Co-organizer Daima Phipps via cash\, Venmo\, or
  Paypal. You are welcome to purchase wine separately if you choose. Starti
 ng March 2025\, we ask that every attending member pay a $1 "slush" fund f
 ee per event so that we can build up our funds for club-related expenses\,
  which can be paid by Venmo or cash.\n\nThere is no food offered\, but you
  are welcome to bring an appetizer or snack to share with the group\, and 
 many ladies do. We will have time to socialize while tasting in the room u
 pstairs to the left or the outside patio if the weather is nice.\n\nThe sp
 ace has a 25 person attendee limit\, but the list is open to 40 to elimina
 te a waitlist\, and guests are welcome! Please RSVP below only if you are 
 able to make it\, we have an attendance policy: if you No-Show to three ev
 ents\, you may not attend events for the next three months. Please put thi
 s event in your calendar so you don't miss out or get dinged. A No-Show is
  when you are on the 'Going' list\, but do not show up.\n\nSee you there\,
  ready to kickoff!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /314849643/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260518T183742Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260518T183742Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
