DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\nFea
 turing The Harvest Band & Mamadios Philly\n\nJoin us for a fun and lively 
 Friday night at Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, located in downto
 wn Healdsburg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and classic co
 mfort food. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the upbeat\, feel-good sou
 nds of The Harvest Band with the bold\, satisfying flavors of Mamadios Phi
 lly.\n\nThe Harvest Band brings a crowd-pleasing mix of familiar favorites
  and danceable tunes\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a relaxed and s
 ocial evening surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longbo
 ard’s wines by the glass or bottle while Mamadios Philly serves their si
 gnature Philadelphia-style cheesesteaks and hearty favorites\, made fresh 
 on site.\n\nFriday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPlease note: This i
 s an over-21 event inside the Barrel Room. Under-21 guests and leashed pet
 s are welcome on the patio only.\n\nCome grab a seat early and enjoy a cla
 ssic Sonoma County night of great music\, great wine\, and great food.\n\n
 Wine available for purchase Live music by The Harvest Band Food by Mamadio
 s Philly \\(Philadelphia-style cheesesteaks and comfort fare\\) Location: 
 Longboard Vineyards Barrel Room Address: 5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\, CA 
 95448
LOCATION:Longboard VIneyards
URL:https://www.longboardvineyards.com
