 nced students a full education in how to paint using Acrylics. Students a
 re given a wealth of information regarding acrylic supplies and materials
  for painting any genre of or style of painting. At each class Hines will
  assist each student in the execution and completion of their painting wi
 th instructions and demonstrations on color\, paint application\, color m
 ixing\, form and composition. This is a great opportunity for anyone wish
 ing to learn how to paint with acrylics as well as oil painters wishing t
 o transition from oils to acrylics.\n\nFee: $40 per class (drop-in)\n\nTo
